<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1400s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 15th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1400s BCE, 64 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 8 were founded and 5 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Egyptian Empire New Kingdom, the Shang dynasty and the Mitanni Empire.</p></header>
